<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-137.1-product-information-model-attribute-taxonomy-and-governance" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4145" name="W4145. Product Information Model &amp; Canonical Catalog Architecture" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: PIM strategy refresh; channel expansion; architecture review
Frequency: Annual + on major change
Volume: Enterprise catalog model (35,000 active SKUs; ~55,000 in master)
Owner: PIM Product Owner / Enterprise Architecture (VS-113)
Participants: Merchandising (VS-01), Ecommerce (VS-10), Master Data (VS-29), Marketing (VS-14), IT (VS-27)
Source: workflow W4145 — Product Information Model &amp; Canonical Catalog Architecture</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4145_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4145_Lane1" name="PIM Owner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4145_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4145_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4145_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4145_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4145_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4145_Start3" name="PIM strategy refresh; channel expansion; architecture review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4145_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4145_Task4" name="PIM/EA define the canonical product information model: the single…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: PIM/EA define the canonical product information model: the single source-of-truth product record (core identity, classification, specs, marketing, commerce, compliance, relationships) consumed by all channels, and its relationship to the ERP item master (VS-29 MDM-021)
Responsible (R): PIM Owner / EA
Accountable (A): Director Ecommerce / CIO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4145_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4145_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4145_Task5" name="PIM/EA design the catalog architecture (category hierarchy, family/variant…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: PIM/EA design the catalog architecture (category hierarchy, family/variant model, channel-specific views, fallback/inheritance rules) and the publication pipeline to each consuming channel
Responsible (R): PIM Owner / Ecommerce
Accountable (A): Director Ecommerce
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4145_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4145_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4145_Task6" name="PIM/EA document the model, obtain architecture-board approval (VS-113), and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: PIM/EA document the model, obtain architecture-board approval (VS-113), and sequence rollout with OCM (VS-134) and the data-engineering team (VS-28.2)
Responsible (R): PIM Owner / EA / IT
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4145_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4145_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4145_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4145_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4145_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-641 (ensure controlled execution — Product Information Model, Attribute Taxonomy &amp; Governance (PA-137.1).) | - CTL-641: canonical model approved by Architecture Board (VS-113); change-controlled schema versioning
Owner: PIM Product Owner / Enterprise Architecture (VS-113)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4145_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4145_Annotation8" targetRef="W4145_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4145_Flow10" sourceRef="W4145_Start3" targetRef="W4145_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4145_Flow11" sourceRef="W4145_Task4" targetRef="W4145_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4145_Flow12" sourceRef="W4145_Task5" targetRef="W4145_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4145_Flow13" sourceRef="W4145_Task6" targetRef="W4145_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4145_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4145_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4145">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4145_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4145_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4145_Task4_di" bpmnElement="W4145_Task4"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
