    <bpmn:process id="W_W4152" name="W4152. Vendor-Supplied Content Intake &amp; Supplier Portal Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor content submission; new vendor onboarding (VS-03)
Frequency: Continuous (~800–1,000 vendors)
Volume: ~40% of new content sourced from vendors (esp. imports/brands)
Owner: PIM Content Lead / Vendor Management (VS-03)
Participants: Vendor, Buyer (VS-01), Sourcing (VS-122), Compliance (VS-117)
Source: workflow W4152 — Vendor-Supplied Content Intake &amp; Supplier Portal Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4152_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4152_Lane1" name="PIM Content Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4152_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4152_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4152_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4152_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4152_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4152_Start3" name="Vendor content submission; new vendor onboarding (VS-03)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4152_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4152_Task4" name="PIM/Vendor Mgmt provide vendors structured content-intake via the supplier…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: PIM/Vendor Mgmt provide vendors structured content-intake via the supplier portal (templates per category — W4146) with validation, and a content-SLA in the vendor agreement (links to VS-03 scorecard W706)
Responsible (R): PIM Content Lead / Vendor Mgmt
Accountable (A): PIM Owner
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4152_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4152_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4152_Task5" name="PIM/Vendor review submitted content for completeness/accuracy/compliance (SDS…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: PIM/Vendor review submitted content for completeness/accuracy/compliance (SDS, certs), normalize to the canonical model, and route exceptions back to vendor
Responsible (R): PIM Content Lead / Compliance
Accountable (A): PIM Owner
Duration: Per submission</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4152_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4152_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4152_Task6" name="PIM track vendor content quality/timeliness, feed into the vendor scorecard…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: PIM track vendor content quality/timeliness, feed into the vendor scorecard (VS-67 W2469/VS-03), and govern portal access/security (VS-27.3)
Responsible (R): PIM Content Lead / Vendor Mgmt
Accountable (A): PIM Owner
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4152_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4152_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4152_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4152_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4152_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-149 (ensure product content accuracy &amp; rights compliance.) | - CTL-641: vendor content-SLA in agreement (links to VS-03); portal access governed (VS-27.3); compliance fields validated
Owner: PIM Content Lead / Vendor Management (VS-03)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
